    "The isolated 1000-row published reader profile measured a 1272455168-byte peak working set from a 57012224-byte baseline. Provenance resolution accounts for roughly half the profiled reader time; per-record contract validation is another material independent cost.",
    "The three observed API requests succeeded with UNKNOWN coverage; the previously reported 10-second timeout was not reproduced in these particular mixed-traffic samples."
